# Vendored schemas and generated spec HTML are checked byte-for-byte: the drift
# gate compares schema/ with the pinned forge-cli release, and generate-docs.py
# --check verifies the "frozen" sha256 map in scripts/schema-versions.json. An
# end-of-line conversion on checkout (core.autocrlf on Windows) would change
# those bytes, so git must never convert them.
schema/** -text
specs/** -text
schema-diffs/** -text
